        "original_id": "5e4a224a-f981-51cd-9e01-8646b0429719",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Colin Morgan, Charlotte Spencer, Nathan Appleby, Charlotte Appleby\n- TV series: The Living and the Dead, Merlin, Humans, The Fall\n- Films: Testament of Youth, Legend\n- Stage works: The Tempest\n\nFacts:\n- Colin Morgan was born on 1 January 1986 and is a British/Irish film, television, theatre, and radio actor.\n- Colin Morgan is best known for playing the title character in the BBC fantasy series Merlin.\n- Colin Morgan had main roles in the TV series Humans and The Fall.\n- Colin Morgan played the lead in The Living and the Dead.\n- Colin Morgan had film roles in Testament of Youth and Legend.\n- Colin Morgan played Ariel in the stage work The Tempest.\n- The plot of The Living and the Dead revolves around Nathan Appleby, played by Colin Morgan, and his wife Charlotte Appleby, played by Charlotte Spencer.\n- In The Living and the Dead, Nathan Appleby and Charlotte Appleby live on a farm believed to be at the centre of numerous supernatural occurrences.",
